        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ihekalu yoombakhwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abanabii, mbu Hagai omunabii, naZakaria waIdo, balakulilanga abaYahudi abali muYuda naYerusalemu, muliira liaNyasaye waIsiraeli owali hekulu wabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Zerubabeli waShealitieli naYeswa waYozadaki nibabuukha, nibachaka ekhuumbakha inzu yaNyasaye eyli eYerusalemu; nabo abanabii baNyasaye bali halala ninabo nibabakhoonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mundaalo etsio Tatenai, omukafuna wolukongo oluli injelekha womwalo, yeetsa ewa bali, halala nende Shetsari-bozenai nende abashiabwe, nibabareeba bari Niwina owamuheelesia omunwa okhuumbakha inzu yino, nokhumalilisia obuumbashi buno? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi nibabareeba bari Ameera kabandu abakholanga obuumbashi buno nibeena? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa Nyasaye wabwe yali nahenganga abakofu babaYahudi, abandu balia nibarabasinjisia emilimo ta, okhuula olwa likhuwa liakhaba niliulile ewaDario, ibarwa yelikalusio niyibakalushila khwikhuwa tsana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikopi yeibarwa eya Tatenai, omukafuna wolukonga oluli injelekha womwalo, naShetsari-bozenai, nabashie abakafuna abali injelekha womwalo, bahandiichila Dario omuruchi, njieyino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bamuhandiichila ibarwa eyahandiikwamwo yiri nanwa; mbu KhuDario omuruchi; omulembe kube khwiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi akhoyile okhumanya mbu khwatsiile mulukongo lwaYuda, enanzu waNyasaye omukhongo. Yumbashilungwa amachina amakhongo, emisaala nichialwa mulukoba; emilimo echio bachitsitsachisinjia neshinani, ne chikaasanga mumakhono kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nikhusungana nabakofu tsana, nikhubareeba mbu Niwina owamuheelesia omunwa okhuumbakha inzu yino, nokhumalilisia omuumbakho kuno? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi nikhubareeba ameera kabwe, mbu khukhumanyie, nikhuhandiika ameera kabandu tsana abali abasinjilili babwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo nibakhukalusia likalusio, bari Khuli abasumba baNyasaye welikulu nende eshialo; khuumbakhanga inzu yino eyoombakhwa khale, emiyika eminji, eya omuruchi undi omukhongo waIsiraeli yoombakha, nachimalilisilia elala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa abakuuka beefwe bali nibamusinyisia Nyasaye welikulu muno, yabahaana mumukhono kwaNebukhadineza omuruchi waBabeli, omuKalidayo; naye niye owalikulula inzu yino, nayila abandu eBabeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumuyika kwambeli kwaKoreshi omuruchi waBabeli, Koreshi omuruchi yahaana omunwa mbu inzu yaNyasaye yino yumbakhwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata ebimanulwa bieitsahaabu nebieifeetsa ebiomunzu yaNyasaye, ebia Nebukhadineza yarusia muhekalu eyili eYerusalemu nabileera muhekalu yeBabeli, Koreshi omuruchi yabirusia muhekalu yeBabeli nabikaamila omundu oulangwa mbu Sheshibaza, owa yali niyeemekha abe kafuna; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namubiila mbu Yila ebimanulwa bino, otsie obire muhekalu eyili eYerusalemu; ne oleshe inzu yaNyasaye yumbakhwe habundu wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Sheshibaza tsana niyeetsa, nakhupa omuse kweinzu yaNyasaye eyili eYerusalemu; ne okhurula khundaalo etsio okhuula olwa leelo, yumbakhungwa, ne yishili okhuhwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano, omuruchi naba nachama, barunilisie mwibiishilo liebitabu liomuruchi elili ebweneyo eBabeli, nikaba nikali kario nohomba, mbu omunwa kwarula khuKoreshi omuruchi mbu inzu yaNyasaye yino yumbakhwe eYerusalemu; mana omuruchi mbu inyu yaNyasaye yino yumbakhwe eYerusalemu; mana omuruchi akhuupile omunwa khuka yeenya khwifwe khwikhuwa lino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
